---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <section class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-slate-400">About</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900">關於我們</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
        智慧網宇實體系統實驗室（ICPS Lab）致力於智慧網宇實體系統領域之前瞻實務與學術研究。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">實驗室介紹</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-600">
          本實驗室致力於在智慧網宇實體系統領域內之前瞻實務與學術研究。
          研究目標融合了人工智慧、物聯網、延展實境（Extended Reality）等技術，
          並透過網路通訊與物理世界的交互，旨在開發出能夠智慧感測與分析之虛實系統解決方案。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 p-8 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">研究範疇</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-600">
          智慧網宇實體系統之研究範疇廣泛，主要涵蓋智慧交通系統、智能製造系統、
          照護醫療系統等領域。ICPS Lab 歡迎對此領域有興趣的同學加入，
          共同開創智慧科技的新紀元。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-slate-50 py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-10 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">English Introduction</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-600">
          ICPS is dedicated to pioneering practical and academic research in the field of intelligent cyber-physical systems.
          Our research objectives integrate technologies such as artificial intelligence, the Internet of Things, and Extended Reality (XR),
          and through the interaction between network communications and the physical world, aim to develop smart system solutions
          that can intelligently sense and analyze both virtual and real-world environments.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-600">
          The research scope of ICPS is broad, primarily covering areas such as intelligent transportation systems,
          smart manufacturing systems, and healthcare systems. ICPS welcomes students interested in this field
          to join us in ushering in a new era of smart technology.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>